   "subject": "Re: where to place code",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The tags$head goes in the UI itself, alongside your controls or whatever. It almost doesn&#39;t matter where you put it, it&#39;ll get promoted to the &lt;head&gt; of the document when it&#39;s rendered.<div><br></div><div>The theme argument would go onto fluidPage, navbarPage, or whatever you&#39;re using to enclose your UI.</div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
